@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Cliente
actor Administrador

rectangle "EcoConteiner Casas" {
    usecase "Consultar modelos" as UC1
    usecase "Visualizar detalhes" as UC2
    usecase "Solicitar orçamento" as UC3
    usecase "Preencher dados" as UC4
    usecase "Calcular estimativa" as UC5
    usecase "Consultar solicitações" as UC6
    usecase "Visualizar status" as UC7
}

Cliente --> UC1
Cliente --> UC2
Cliente --> UC3

UC3 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC5 : <<include>>

Administrador --> UC6
Administrador --> UC7

note bottom of UC6
Painel demonstrativo
sem autenticação
end note

@enduml